WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 24=

01:52.047 --> 01:57.347
(Beijing Souvenir)

02:02.004 --> 02:04.660
(Standing with Comrade Xu Hongqi
in the development of socialism)

02:19.147 --> 02:20.188
I'm heading to work.

02:35.107 --> 02:36.348
Everyone, listen up.

02:36.715 --> 02:38.460
(Ensure Quality, Secure Supply)
Starting today,

02:38.468 --> 02:39.867
Director Xu will...

02:40.715 --> 02:42.048
I'm not a director anymore.

02:42.908 --> 02:43.987
Just Xu Hongqi.

02:44.222 --> 02:46.303
Didn't expect Director Xu
to be back on the floor.

02:46.788 --> 02:47.508
Keep it down.

02:47.508 --> 02:50.188
Let's welcome Comrade Xu Hongqi.

02:50.348 --> 02:51.308
Starting today,

02:51.308 --> 02:53.028
she is a member of Workshop One.

02:59.068 --> 02:59.628
Right.

02:59.628 --> 03:00.387
Li Weihong,

03:00.387 --> 03:01.987
take Comrade Xu Hongqi

03:02.547 --> 03:03.667
and show her around.

03:04.628 --> 03:05.068
No need.

03:05.982 --> 03:08.315
I've been a textile worker
for over twenty years.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.048
I know this place

03:10.827 --> 03:11.427
very well.

03:14.348 --> 03:15.068
Alright.

03:15.068 --> 03:15.908
Li Weihong,

03:15.908 --> 03:18.348
take Comrade Xu to your machine unit.

03:25.228 --> 03:25.948
Okay, okay.

03:25.948 --> 03:26.788
Everyone,

03:27.068 --> 03:28.308
back to work.

03:28.628 --> 03:29.348
Back to work.

03:38.810 --> 03:42.147
(Strive for the future of our land.
Fang Qingyuan, Mu Shanhe)

03:45.147 --> 03:46.547
Why are you showing me this?

03:47.093 --> 03:49.060
Our parents want us
to pick them up in Yunnan.

03:51.948 --> 03:52.748
Did you forget?

03:53.468 --> 03:55.147
I already cut ties with them.

03:56.068 --> 03:56.788
Besides,

03:57.115 --> 03:58.500
the letter was addressed to you,

03:58.948 --> 03:59.707
not me.

04:05.948 --> 04:06.667
But,

04:07.508 --> 04:09.110
they're hoping you'll come.

04:10.267 --> 04:11.267
Cut ties?

04:11.948 --> 04:13.028
That was in the past.

04:14.107 --> 04:15.228
Things are different now.

04:16.467 --> 04:17.267
You don't get it.

04:18.108 --> 04:19.227
You studied art.

04:19.227 --> 04:20.308
I studied math.

04:21.027 --> 04:22.948
If a drawing's wrong, you can fix it.

04:22.948 --> 04:23.748
You can erase it.

04:24.508 --> 04:25.748
But in math, one wrong step

04:25.871 --> 04:27.060
means everything after that

04:27.068 --> 04:27.948
is wrong, too.

04:30.707 --> 04:31.707
I don't know math.

04:33.347 --> 04:34.267
But I know our parents.

04:36.628 --> 04:37.668
I bought your ticket.

04:38.137 --> 04:39.448
See you at the station tomorrow.

04:46.322 --> 04:51.447
(Jiangcheng to Western Yunnan)

04:59.027 --> 04:59.948
Vice Director.

05:01.068 --> 05:01.948
Comrade Ye Feng.

05:01.948 --> 05:02.748
What is it?

05:03.108 --> 05:05.147
I've been hearing
rumors around the factory.

05:05.308 --> 05:06.707
They're saying the basketball team

05:06.748 --> 05:08.748
is being disbanded.

05:10.628 --> 05:10.948
Yes.

05:11.108 --> 05:12.347
A notice was issued.

05:12.471 --> 05:14.060
As for which departments you'll join,

05:14.347 --> 05:16.628
that depends on discussions

05:16.628 --> 05:18.308
between you and the department heads.

05:18.628 --> 05:19.948
A two-way choice.

05:19.948 --> 05:22.027
We respect personal preference,

05:22.227 --> 05:23.988
but we also consider
organizational needs.

05:24.668 --> 05:25.508
Vice Director,

05:26.868 --> 05:28.827
how can our factory
not have a basketball team?

05:29.267 --> 05:30.467
If we can't train every day,

05:30.467 --> 05:31.508
our tactics and teamwork

05:31.508 --> 05:33.827
won't measure up to other teams.

05:33.827 --> 05:35.147
What happens when we lose?

05:35.147 --> 05:36.707
Then we lose.

05:37.068 --> 05:39.027
We're a textile factory,

05:39.027 --> 05:40.548
not a sports academy.

05:40.948 --> 05:42.948
Since when is losing a game
such a big deal?

05:43.347 --> 05:44.387
Vice Director,

05:44.707 --> 05:46.099
how can you say that?

05:46.100 --> 05:47.848
Don't you have any competitive spirit?

05:57.347 --> 05:58.347
Comrade Ye Feng,

05:58.827 --> 06:00.188
my competitive spirit

06:00.428 --> 06:02.628
is reserved
for meeting production targets,

06:02.948 --> 06:04.508
not winning on the court.

06:04.628 --> 06:05.267
As for you,

06:05.467 --> 06:07.748
either find a division
that will take you,

06:08.827 --> 06:09.467
or figure out

06:09.668 --> 06:10.548
your own future.

06:10.948 --> 06:11.668
It's up to you.

06:11.668 --> 06:12.188
Wait...

06:22.587 --> 06:23.948
Which department are you going to?

06:24.787 --> 06:25.748
Logistics.

06:26.308 --> 06:27.188
Lucky you,

06:27.626 --> 06:28.780
you're heading to Transport.

06:29.948 --> 06:31.387
I wish I could, but Director Liu

06:31.868 --> 06:32.707
wouldn't take me.

06:32.707 --> 06:34.787
Captain, what did the Vice Director say?

06:39.548 --> 06:41.748
We may not be full-time players anymore,

06:42.147 --> 06:43.267
but training

06:43.467 --> 06:44.508
still has to continue.

06:45.347 --> 06:46.587
After work every day,

06:46.604 --> 06:47.380
we should at least

06:47.387 --> 06:49.347
maintain one hour of practice.

06:50.188 --> 06:51.108
Can we do that?

06:54.948 --> 06:57.267
What's wrong with you all?
Say something.

06:58.387 --> 06:59.227
Captain,

06:59.548 --> 07:01.308
I'm in Transport now.

07:01.668 --> 07:03.587
I'll be driving all over the place.

07:04.068 --> 07:07.108
Yeah, Logistics is swamped too.

07:07.668 --> 07:09.379
Captain, which department are you in?

07:09.380 --> 07:10.448
You seem pretty free.

07:10.907 --> 07:13.147
I haven't secured one yet.

07:13.988 --> 07:15.497
Maybe I'll join you in Transport.

07:16.787 --> 07:18.988
Transport is already full.

07:18.988 --> 07:19.787
Full?

07:21.147 --> 07:22.347
What about Logistics?

07:22.868 --> 07:23.548
Also full.

07:25.188 --> 07:26.227
Maintenance is full too.

07:26.428 --> 07:27.827
Security's full.

07:28.907 --> 07:29.907
They're all full?

07:31.188 --> 07:32.587
So you all grabbed the good spots.

07:32.587 --> 07:33.668
Where does that leave me?

07:36.948 --> 07:37.787
Wang Yaozu,

07:38.267 --> 07:39.347
I set you up

07:39.347 --> 07:40.988
with the most assists in matches.

07:41.948 --> 07:42.548
So,

07:43.027 --> 07:45.308
why don't you give me
your slot in Transport?

07:45.308 --> 07:46.948
Transport's already finalized.

07:47.387 --> 07:48.868
Maybe try another department.

07:52.108 --> 07:53.748
You can't grab rebounds,

07:54.707 --> 07:56.508
but you're quick to grab a position.

07:58.068 --> 07:58.868
Captain,

07:59.188 --> 08:00.988
the cafeteria line needs help.

08:00.988 --> 08:01.467
Maybe you...

08:01.467 --> 08:02.347
What did you say?

08:03.707 --> 08:04.508
Serving food?

08:06.188 --> 08:07.467
Do you know who I am?

08:07.467 --> 08:08.707
You want me to serve you?

08:09.988 --> 08:11.267
I dare you to eat the food!

08:13.188 --> 08:13.988
Choke on it.

08:22.397 --> 08:25.560
(Unite and Strive for Greater Victory)

08:58.948 --> 08:59.788
Director Xu,

09:00.668 --> 09:03.788
thank you for
the handwritten copy and permission to

09:03.915 --> 09:05.048
go to the disaster area.

09:08.548 --> 09:09.908
Why thank me?

09:11.068 --> 09:14.268
I followed policy
and official guidelines.

09:14.908 --> 09:16.107
I favor no one,

09:16.388 --> 09:17.388
and target no one.

09:19.826 --> 09:20.780
If you're grateful,

09:21.268 --> 09:22.188
thank the Party,

09:22.537 --> 09:23.540
and thank the people.

09:28.404 --> 09:29.404
And one more thing.

09:30.028 --> 09:31.587
I'm not a director anymore.

09:32.388 --> 09:34.388
That title doesn't fit.

09:35.987 --> 09:37.268
Just call me Ms. Xu.

09:38.747 --> 09:40.388
Got it, Ms. Xu.

09:43.507 --> 09:45.827
The food looks decent today.

09:45.827 --> 09:47.587
Let's sit here.

09:47.587 --> 09:48.388
There's space.

09:49.467 --> 09:50.148
Fei Ni.

09:55.308 --> 09:56.587
Sit. Eat with us.

09:58.788 --> 10:00.388
Come on, sit. Let's eat together.

10:04.388 --> 10:05.188
Try this.

10:07.467 --> 10:08.268
The greens are good.

10:10.388 --> 10:12.548
Have some vegetables.

10:13.548 --> 10:14.467
Alright, I'll try some.

10:16.028 --> 10:16.668
Go on.

10:16.668 --> 10:17.867
Thank you, Director Xu.

10:18.467 --> 10:19.107
No, no.

10:19.347 --> 10:20.347
It's just Ms. Xu.

10:20.788 --> 10:22.068
- Ms. Xu.
- Ms. Xu.

10:27.867 --> 10:28.668
It's really good.

10:44.587 --> 10:46.188
Mom!

10:49.148 --> 10:49.948
What is it?

10:49.948 --> 10:52.747
I don't know
what Vice Director Chen is thinking.

10:52.747 --> 10:54.668
He's actually disbanding
our basketball team.

10:55.788 --> 10:57.507
So what happens to you now?

10:57.867 --> 10:58.587
We're being

10:58.587 --> 11:00.948
split up into different
departments and production lines.

11:02.548 --> 11:03.867
Then, just join one.

11:03.867 --> 11:04.587
Mom.

11:04.982 --> 11:05.700
The problem is,

11:05.707 --> 11:07.867
all the good departments
are already taken.

11:08.068 --> 11:09.707
I asked around everywhere.

11:09.948 --> 11:11.948
Only the cafeteria
and gate security are left.

11:12.908 --> 11:14.388
So which one do you prefer?

11:14.908 --> 11:16.668
I don't like either of them.

11:17.308 --> 11:18.987
Why should I serve them food

11:18.987 --> 11:19.788
or guard the gate?

11:20.467 --> 11:23.388
Son, that's not the right attitude.

11:24.308 --> 11:25.587
Didn't you say before

11:25.867 --> 11:27.908
that no job is beneath anyone?

11:29.107 --> 11:30.707
The cafeteria isn't bad.

11:30.908 --> 11:32.148
People need food to live.

11:32.388 --> 11:34.107
Miss one meal and you'll feel it.

11:34.227 --> 11:35.188
Go to the cafeteria.

11:35.987 --> 11:37.308
I don't have time for this.

11:37.308 --> 11:38.747
I need to get to work.

11:38.908 --> 11:39.707
Mom!

11:39.788 --> 11:40.548
The cafeteria!

11:41.987 --> 11:42.788
The cafeteria...

12:02.960 --> 12:03.980
You're going on a trip?

12:06.308 --> 12:07.548
My parents are coming back.

12:08.093 --> 12:09.700
Fang Muyang wants me to go with him

12:10.148 --> 12:11.587
to pick them up in Yunnan.

12:16.987 --> 12:18.548
I hear Yunnan's beautiful.

12:18.948 --> 12:19.867
Go if you want to.

12:22.148 --> 12:23.148
I don't.

12:27.548 --> 12:28.587
Is it because

12:29.293 --> 12:30.500
you're afraid to face them?

12:35.260 --> 12:36.535
(Jiangcheng to Western Yunnan)

12:39.668 --> 12:41.885
When they were at their lowest,

12:42.122 --> 12:43.881
you chose to distance yourself.

12:44.668 --> 12:46.068
Now they're coming back,

12:46.507 --> 12:48.948
and you don't know how to face them.

12:53.308 --> 12:54.548
It's complicated.

12:58.668 --> 12:59.948
But you're so smart.

13:00.148 --> 13:01.227
Aren't you good at

13:01.428 --> 13:03.148
solving complicated problems?

13:06.987 --> 13:07.788
Mujing,

13:08.507 --> 13:09.467
do you remember

13:09.827 --> 13:11.548
what you once told me?

13:13.467 --> 13:14.308
You said

13:15.404 --> 13:16.780
your father's surname is Fang,

13:17.467 --> 13:18.548
and your mother's is Mu.

13:20.148 --> 13:21.788
That's how you got your name.

13:23.388 --> 13:24.747
You never really

13:25.068 --> 13:26.788
cut ties with them.

13:30.908 --> 13:34.668
Whether you reconcile or break for good,

13:35.788 --> 13:36.948
you still have to face them.

13:41.587 --> 13:43.347
Whatever you decide,

13:45.347 --> 13:46.788
I'll stand by you.

13:49.548 --> 13:50.747
You'll always have family.

13:52.068 --> 13:52.948
The kind

13:53.747 --> 13:55.507
you can never truly cut off.

14:14.135 --> 14:17.072
(Strive for the future of our land.
Fang Qingyuan, Mu Shanhe)

15:14.972 --> 15:19.585
(Learn from Comrade Lei Feng)

15:19.635 --> 15:23.410
(Jiangcheng City)

15:56.028 --> 15:57.467
I don't think your sister's coming.

15:57.467 --> 15:58.587
You should get on first.

15:59.908 --> 16:01.827
Take care of yourself over there.

16:02.068 --> 16:03.707
You haven't seen your parents in years.

16:03.707 --> 16:04.987
If they miss you too much,

16:05.107 --> 16:07.028
stay a few extra days with them.

16:08.227 --> 16:08.987
Go on.

16:09.467 --> 16:10.507
You take care, too.

16:11.068 --> 16:11.908
Don't worry about me.

16:15.308 --> 16:16.068
Go on.

17:55.467 --> 17:56.707
Excuse me.

18:00.908 --> 18:01.628
Stop here.

18:18.868 --> 18:19.588
Dad.

18:21.335 --> 18:24.085
(Fang Qingyuan)

18:26.428 --> 18:27.227
(Mu Shanhe)
Mom.

18:27.227 --> 18:28.060
(Mu Shanhe)

18:45.108 --> 18:45.908
Yang.

18:49.588 --> 18:50.227
Dad.

19:30.227 --> 19:31.067
Dad, Mom,

19:33.267 --> 19:34.707
I've come to take you home.

19:38.471 --> 19:39.420
You've gotten sturdier.

19:45.072 --> 19:45.792
Taller, too.

19:47.428 --> 19:49.908
All grown up. That's wonderful.

19:50.828 --> 19:51.628
So wonderful.

19:58.110 --> 19:58.951
This is...

20:02.067 --> 20:03.507
Grandma left it to me.

20:08.868 --> 20:09.987
Does it still keep time?

20:10.828 --> 20:11.628
It does.

20:12.707 --> 20:13.787
It's always been accurate.

20:16.108 --> 20:16.747
Good.

20:18.467 --> 20:19.668
You're married now?

20:20.067 --> 20:20.868
Yes.

20:22.071 --> 20:23.300
Let me show you something.

20:24.987 --> 20:25.747
I drew it.

20:26.668 --> 20:28.108
Fei Ni is very beautiful.

20:30.707 --> 20:32.067
This is our daughter-in-law.

20:33.707 --> 20:35.668
She's waiting in Jiangcheng for you.

20:37.787 --> 20:38.787
How is Mujing?

20:46.507 --> 20:47.307
She's doing well.

20:48.067 --> 20:49.027
She's married, too.

20:50.428 --> 20:51.868
Her husband is a neurosurgeon.

20:52.382 --> 20:53.500
He treats her very well.

20:55.707 --> 20:56.507
That's good.

20:57.428 --> 20:58.227
That's good.

20:59.628 --> 21:00.787
She's just busy with work,

21:01.982 --> 21:03.448
so she couldn't come pick you up.

21:04.787 --> 21:06.588
Come on, let's head home.

21:06.987 --> 21:08.067
We'll start packing.

21:18.710 --> 21:22.397
("Heroes in Earthquake Relief"
By Fang Muyang)

21:33.435 --> 21:36.960
("Heroes in Earthquake Relief"
By Fang Muyang)

22:02.747 --> 22:03.507
Fei Ting.

22:05.027 --> 22:06.027
Mr. Li.

22:06.747 --> 22:08.547
Another banquet job?

22:08.547 --> 22:09.148
No, no.

22:09.148 --> 22:10.908
I wouldn't dare
take that kind of work now.

22:13.108 --> 22:14.027
Here's the thing.

22:14.093 --> 22:15.300
The cafeteria's short-staffed.

22:15.300 --> 22:16.493
They need a kitchen assistant.

22:16.547 --> 22:17.348
Interested?

22:18.027 --> 22:19.027
Of course I am.

22:20.348 --> 22:21.948
But I was dismissed from the factory.

22:23.027 --> 22:23.987
Don't worry about that.

22:24.628 --> 22:26.027
I spoke to the Vice Director.

22:26.347 --> 22:28.547
Told him you're honest and dependable,

22:28.547 --> 22:29.685
and that you're responsible.

22:29.908 --> 22:32.185
He thought it over and agreed.

22:33.227 --> 22:34.987
But let me be clear.

22:35.277 --> 22:36.897
The pay for kitchen help isn't like

22:36.897 --> 22:37.837
what you used to make.

22:37.940 --> 22:38.560
That's fine.

22:38.828 --> 22:40.787
As long as I can cook for the workers,

22:40.787 --> 22:42.027
I'll do it no matter the pay.

22:42.267 --> 22:43.227
Wonderful!

22:43.267 --> 22:44.640
See you at the cafeteria tomorrow.

22:44.828 --> 22:45.707
I'll head back now.

22:57.987 --> 23:00.227
I wonder if Ni's in-laws are
easy to get along with.

23:00.507 --> 23:02.188
Stop worrying about nothing.

23:02.747 --> 23:04.507
They're intellectuals.

23:04.507 --> 23:05.828
How hard could they be?

23:06.507 --> 23:07.588
That's where you're wrong.

23:08.227 --> 23:09.787
Intellectuals can be pretty aloof.

23:10.307 --> 23:11.699
Look at how things are

23:11.700 --> 23:13.204
between them and their own daughter.

23:14.307 --> 23:15.908
And this is their daughter-in-law.

23:17.108 --> 23:18.227
Don't talk nonsense,

23:18.227 --> 23:19.188
Comrade Wu Baoying.

23:19.307 --> 23:20.428
That's where you're wrong.

23:20.747 --> 23:23.108
Have you forgotten who he married?

23:23.108 --> 23:25.227
Ni is a wonderful girl.

23:25.227 --> 23:26.067
If our family

23:26.628 --> 23:28.828
had a daughter-in-law like her,

23:29.227 --> 23:30.588
I'd be laughing in my sleep,

23:30.588 --> 23:32.348
waking up from happy dreams.

23:34.108 --> 23:34.868
Dad,

23:35.148 --> 23:36.108
so what you're saying is

23:36.108 --> 23:37.948
I'm not a good enough daughter-in-law?

23:38.227 --> 23:39.027
No.

23:39.547 --> 23:40.628
That's not what I meant.

23:40.948 --> 23:42.948
I'm very happy you married Fei Ting.

23:42.948 --> 23:45.027
I've woken up smiling
plenty of times too.

23:46.707 --> 23:47.707
Mom, Dad,

23:47.707 --> 23:48.987
extra flavors for dinner tonight.

23:50.948 --> 23:52.388
What's the good news?

23:56.188 --> 23:57.588
Mom, Dad,

23:58.108 --> 24:00.948
I've been reassigned.

24:02.707 --> 24:03.547
Reassigned where?

24:03.948 --> 24:04.948
The Factory Office?

24:05.828 --> 24:06.787
To the cafeteria.

24:09.188 --> 24:10.027
What?

24:10.227 --> 24:11.707
Who transferred you to the cafeteria?

24:11.760 --> 24:13.500
You're an officer
in the Publicity Division.

24:13.507 --> 24:14.828
Why the cafeteria?

24:15.948 --> 24:17.148
Are they sidelining you?

24:19.027 --> 24:19.628
Mom, Dad,

24:19.628 --> 24:20.467
this is

24:20.868 --> 24:21.908
all my fault.

24:22.428 --> 24:24.628
I should've told you.

24:25.227 --> 24:27.227
I left the Publicity Division
quite a while ago.

24:27.760 --> 24:29.100
I was fired before the earthquake.

24:30.108 --> 24:31.067
Dismissed?

24:31.227 --> 24:31.987
Mom...

24:31.987 --> 24:33.188
Who fired you?

24:34.428 --> 24:35.948
Xu Hongqi, right? I'll go find her!

24:35.948 --> 24:38.027
Mom, please, just listen to me.

24:38.428 --> 24:40.507
This has nothing to do with her.

24:41.428 --> 24:42.227
It was me.

24:43.428 --> 24:45.108
I just don't like writing articles.

24:47.027 --> 24:48.868
Now the factory's giving me a chance

24:49.148 --> 24:50.227
to help out in the kitchen.

24:50.588 --> 24:52.027
I honestly think it's a good fit.

24:52.182 --> 24:53.940
I can even
learn some skills from Mr. Li.

25:02.787 --> 25:03.267
Lin Mei,

25:04.428 --> 25:06.948
you allow this?

25:07.388 --> 25:08.188
Mom,

25:08.547 --> 25:10.908
if I could control him,
I would've done it already.

25:11.148 --> 25:12.628
The cafeteria's fine.

25:12.747 --> 25:15.027
At least he has a job, right?

25:19.707 --> 25:20.507
Fine.

25:21.547 --> 25:22.348
Fine.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.348
Nobody says another word.

25:23.348 --> 25:23.948
I'll go cook.

25:24.707 --> 25:25.908
I'll help you, Mom.

25:37.188 --> 25:38.027
You know...

25:41.707 --> 25:43.908
You really do belong in a cafeteria.

25:51.588 --> 25:53.828
Everyone has their own path.

25:53.828 --> 25:56.707
You can't force...

25:56.707 --> 25:57.507
Shut up!

26:15.647 --> 26:20.227
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

26:20.227 --> 26:21.027
Mr. Qiu.

26:22.600 --> 26:24.782
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)
Let me introduce them.

26:25.108 --> 26:26.227
This comrade

26:26.227 --> 26:28.507
used to work in the Publicity Division,

26:28.507 --> 26:29.588
Comrade Fei Ting.

26:30.747 --> 26:32.588
As for him, no introduction needed.

26:32.588 --> 26:33.588
You all know him.

26:33.787 --> 26:35.668
Former captain of our basketball team,

26:35.747 --> 26:36.707
Comrade Ye Feng.

26:37.227 --> 26:38.348
Let's welcome them

26:38.428 --> 26:40.428
to the cafeteria team.

26:40.635 --> 26:43.010
(Unite and Strive for Greater Victory)

26:44.307 --> 26:45.547
Starting today,

26:45.628 --> 26:46.828
we help each other

26:46.828 --> 26:47.787
and learn together.

26:48.628 --> 26:49.707
Let's get to work.

26:50.188 --> 26:51.027
Comrade Ye Feng,

26:51.507 --> 26:52.828
if you're at the serving window

26:52.828 --> 26:54.307
and hear any feedback

26:54.307 --> 26:56.507
from our fellow workers
about the food,

26:56.507 --> 26:57.507
pass it on to me.

26:57.507 --> 26:58.507
It'll help us improve.

26:59.027 --> 27:00.828
You've got great energy

27:00.828 --> 27:01.828
with that ladle.

27:02.188 --> 27:04.428
Of course.
Food is the foundation of the people.

27:04.707 --> 27:07.108
We have to make sure
everyone eats their fill

27:07.108 --> 27:08.027
and eats well.

27:09.428 --> 27:10.227
Don't forget.

27:33.987 --> 27:36.547
Watch it. You spilled the soup.

27:39.188 --> 27:39.987
Meal ticket.

27:48.428 --> 27:49.428
Comrade Ye Feng,

27:51.908 --> 27:54.027
serving food
is just like playing basketball.

27:54.307 --> 27:56.787
One feeds the spirit,

27:56.987 --> 27:59.108
the other feeds the body.

28:06.267 --> 28:07.828
So no matter the post,

28:08.348 --> 28:10.428
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory
stands united.

28:12.588 --> 28:14.148
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!)

28:14.148 --> 28:17.787
- Never give up!
- Never give up!

28:17.787 --> 28:21.188
- Overcome all obstacles!
- Overcome all obstacles!

28:21.188 --> 28:25.507
- Strive for victory!
- Strive for victory!

28:26.348 --> 28:27.188
Never give up!

28:27.428 --> 28:28.348
Always moving forward.

28:41.188 --> 28:42.027
Next.

28:54.307 --> 28:55.108
Never give up.

29:00.027 --> 29:00.828
You...

29:00.908 --> 29:01.707
But...

29:01.828 --> 29:03.428
You gave her so many pieces of meat.

29:04.227 --> 29:05.707
Why do I only get one?

29:06.148 --> 29:06.948
Have an issue?

29:07.507 --> 29:08.507
Come serve it yourself.

29:10.148 --> 29:10.948
Next.

29:20.868 --> 29:21.388
More meat.

29:21.388 --> 29:21.987
All right.

29:21.987 --> 29:22.787
Thank you.

29:28.027 --> 29:28.948
Tastes good?

29:30.828 --> 29:32.428
Why are you dressed like this?

29:32.428 --> 29:34.348
I'm now a kitchen assistant
in the cafeteria.

29:34.707 --> 29:35.828
I cooked this dish.

29:36.188 --> 29:37.628
How is it?

29:37.828 --> 29:40.307
No wonder today's food tastes so good.

29:40.307 --> 29:41.747
We've got a master chef.

29:43.348 --> 29:44.908
If anyone has feedback on the dishes,

29:44.908 --> 29:45.828
just speak up.

29:46.707 --> 29:47.787
Go on, eat.

29:49.067 --> 29:49.747
All right.

29:53.707 --> 29:55.148
Her old flame serves the food,

29:55.148 --> 29:56.307
and her own brother cooks it.

29:56.307 --> 29:57.188
Comrade Fei Ni

29:57.188 --> 29:59.428
really has connections in our cafeteria.

30:01.388 --> 30:03.948
Yes, I do have connections here.

30:03.948 --> 30:04.908
So, don't eat here.

30:11.948 --> 30:12.419
I heard

30:12.420 --> 30:14.560
Fang Muyang's parents are
coming back to Jiangcheng.

30:14.747 --> 30:17.188
His father's a famous painter,

30:17.188 --> 30:18.948
and his mother's a university lecturer.

30:19.908 --> 30:22.388
Looks like
the whole family's back on top.

30:23.588 --> 30:26.428
Some people's good days might be over.

30:26.948 --> 30:27.908
Feng Lin,

30:28.188 --> 30:29.307
what are you talking about?

30:29.307 --> 30:30.588
What did I say?

30:30.908 --> 30:31.360
Back then,

30:31.360 --> 30:33.428
Fang Muyang was always
hanging around the factory,

30:33.428 --> 30:35.108
picking her up and dropping her off.

30:35.348 --> 30:37.547
Haven't seen him in ages now.

30:38.027 --> 30:39.588
Isn't it obvious?

30:39.588 --> 30:40.388
Fei Ni

30:40.388 --> 30:43.428
finally climbed up high,
and now the branch is snapping.

30:44.588 --> 30:46.027
Snapping how?

30:54.307 --> 30:56.027
Fang Muyang's done with her.

30:56.027 --> 30:57.108
He's breaking up with her...

30:57.707 --> 30:58.828
When did you get back?

31:00.828 --> 31:01.828
Just got off the train.

31:02.188 --> 31:04.547
I dropped my luggage at home
and came straight here.

31:17.307 --> 31:18.588
Good thing I came.

31:19.828 --> 31:20.828
Comrade Feng Lin,

31:21.307 --> 31:22.948
that's not quite right.

31:23.628 --> 31:24.067
I'm the one

31:24.067 --> 31:26.027
who married up into the working class.

31:36.348 --> 31:37.108
Forget it.

31:37.848 --> 31:38.982
Where are Mom and Dad?

31:39.227 --> 31:39.987
They just arrived.

31:39.987 --> 31:41.507
Their old colleagues picked them up.

31:41.948 --> 31:43.348
Sit down. You haven't eaten, right?

31:43.348 --> 31:43.787
Sit.

31:45.108 --> 31:45.908
Have mine.

31:47.547 --> 31:50.108
Try this. My brother cooked it.

31:50.348 --> 31:51.148
Is it good?

31:58.828 --> 31:59.588
Let's share.

32:03.493 --> 32:04.180
Ms. Liu, you...

32:04.188 --> 32:05.067
I tripped.

32:05.588 --> 32:06.747
I banged my knee.

32:08.828 --> 32:10.948
You two take your time.

32:16.747 --> 32:17.547
Have a bite.

32:51.227 --> 32:53.027
Nice tea.

32:56.188 --> 32:58.188
This house is always
running out of stuff.

32:58.828 --> 33:00.148
There's still tea at home,

33:00.148 --> 33:01.428
and you've opened a new tin.

33:02.027 --> 33:03.948
What kind of talk is that?

33:04.428 --> 33:06.227
The in-laws asked Fang

33:06.227 --> 33:08.188
to bring me
a local specialty from Yunnan,

33:08.188 --> 33:09.588
some Yunnan tea.

33:09.671 --> 33:10.780
I've never tried it before.

33:10.787 --> 33:12.588
Of course I have to savor it.

33:12.908 --> 33:13.588
Right?

33:13.987 --> 33:14.948
Go on, taste it.

33:19.307 --> 33:20.108
My honey,

33:20.747 --> 33:22.388
I heard from Fang that

33:22.787 --> 33:23.635
since his parents

33:23.635 --> 33:24.588
are now back,

33:24.588 --> 33:26.908
the organization
is giving them back two rooms

33:26.908 --> 33:27.787
in their old house

33:27.787 --> 33:31.148
on Kangnan Road.

33:31.588 --> 33:32.828
That's great.

33:33.188 --> 33:34.547
Kangnan Road is close to us.

33:34.547 --> 33:35.828
It'll be easy to visit.

33:37.307 --> 33:38.188
That's wonderful.

33:38.588 --> 33:39.747
Wonderful arrangement.

33:42.628 --> 33:44.267
Come on, go to the market with me.

33:45.828 --> 33:47.628
Aren't they coming tomorrow?

33:47.628 --> 33:48.828
Tomorrow will be too late.

33:48.828 --> 33:50.108
Come on, hurry up.

33:50.108 --> 33:51.547
What's the rush?

33:51.547 --> 33:52.588
Wait, wait.

33:53.908 --> 33:54.547
Let's go.

33:54.847 --> 33:58.560
(People's Hospital Staff Quarters)

34:11.828 --> 34:13.507
You work your brain so hard every day.

34:13.748 --> 34:14.708
You should eat more.

34:16.587 --> 34:17.627
I don't have much appetite.

34:22.748 --> 34:23.507
That's perfect.

34:23.948 --> 34:24.908
I'm off tomorrow.

34:25.187 --> 34:27.428
How about we go out for a walk

34:27.428 --> 34:28.948
and grab a meal outside?

34:33.948 --> 34:35.748
Fang Muyang called me.

34:36.308 --> 34:37.428
He said your parents are back

34:38.547 --> 34:39.388
and invited us

34:39.828 --> 34:40.908
and Fei Ni's family

34:41.226 --> 34:42.580
to have a reunion dinner together.

34:43.748 --> 34:44.547
I even bought gifts.

34:53.428 --> 34:55.547
Just think of it as a trip with me.

34:57.308 --> 34:58.708
As their son-in-law,

34:58.708 --> 35:01.107
I should meet my in-laws at least once.

35:01.428 --> 35:02.908
Otherwise, it would be improper.

35:13.987 --> 35:15.428
If you start feeling uncomfortable,

35:15.627 --> 35:16.908
we can leave anytime.

35:17.788 --> 35:18.428
All right?

35:27.828 --> 35:28.708
Let's eat first.

35:42.587 --> 35:43.547
What's on your mind?

35:45.187 --> 35:47.428
I should go back tomorrow
and change my clothes.

35:49.748 --> 35:51.587
Do you think my mom's cooking is good?

35:51.587 --> 35:53.228
Should we buy a couple more dishes?

35:53.428 --> 35:53.987
No need.

35:54.547 --> 35:56.228
What your mom usually makes is great.

35:58.537 --> 35:59.780
Your parents just got back.

35:59.780 --> 36:01.493
They probably haven't
bought anything yet.

36:01.788 --> 36:03.507
I traded for these industrial coupons.

36:03.547 --> 36:05.027
Get them a few things later.

36:05.428 --> 36:06.587
We're seeing them tomorrow.

36:06.748 --> 36:07.828
You can give them in person.

36:09.507 --> 36:10.308
All right.

36:13.627 --> 36:16.139
For this first meeting,

36:16.140 --> 36:17.848
should I call them
Mr. Fang and Mrs. Fang,

36:17.871 --> 36:18.900
or Mom and Dad?

36:19.428 --> 36:20.507
Of course, Mom and Dad.

36:21.187 --> 36:22.587
We've been married for ages.

36:24.308 --> 36:26.187
Calling them Mom and Dad right away?

36:26.748 --> 36:28.187
Won't that feel a little strange?

36:28.828 --> 36:29.908
Don't worry.

36:30.587 --> 36:31.819
In their hearts,

36:31.820 --> 36:34.026
they've long accepted you
as their daughter-in-law.

36:37.228 --> 36:38.748
And they'll probably feel guilty.

36:40.908 --> 36:41.788
Why?

36:43.147 --> 36:44.388
In my parents' eyes,

36:45.507 --> 36:47.107
someone as useless as me

36:47.226 --> 36:49.293
didn't starve to death
in Great Northern Wilderness

36:49.388 --> 36:50.348
and even found a wife.

36:51.187 --> 36:52.748
They'll think I'm a burden to you

36:52.748 --> 36:53.708
and your whole family.

36:57.987 --> 36:58.708
Tomorrow,

36:58.708 --> 36:59.708
make sure you tell them

36:59.948 --> 37:01.027
you've been living well.

37:03.027 --> 37:03.828
Fang Muyang,

37:06.228 --> 37:08.587
I'm finally going
to be part of your family.

37:15.828 --> 37:17.428
Would you like to move in with us?

37:19.828 --> 37:22.348
The organization reassigned us two rooms

37:22.507 --> 37:23.547
in our Kangnan Road house.

37:24.107 --> 37:25.987
My parents will take one.
The other's empty.

37:26.428 --> 37:27.987
It's not luxurious,

37:28.115 --> 37:29.137
but it's better than here.

37:31.027 --> 37:33.228
If your parents are okay with it,

37:33.828 --> 37:35.187
I'd love to.

37:36.708 --> 37:37.507
Good.

38:00.627 --> 38:02.187
What are you two dawdling for?

38:02.187 --> 38:04.147
Hurry up. They'll be here soon.

38:05.187 --> 38:05.868
Ni,

38:06.788 --> 38:08.147
why haven't you changed yet?

38:08.147 --> 38:09.748
Mom, how does this one look?

38:09.748 --> 38:11.147
Fine.

38:11.187 --> 38:11.987
Go change.

38:12.828 --> 38:13.788
Come on, they'll...

38:14.987 --> 38:16.308
Let me look at this a bit more.

38:16.308 --> 38:17.107
I'm telling you,

38:17.187 --> 38:19.987
I need some
common ground with our in-laws.

38:19.987 --> 38:22.187
What if they start talking
about Zhang Daqian

38:22.187 --> 38:23.627
or Qi Baishi?

38:23.627 --> 38:25.228
I won't get a word in.

38:25.228 --> 38:26.587
I need to study up.

38:26.828 --> 38:28.027
They'll be here any minute.

38:28.027 --> 38:29.107
What's there to study?

38:29.107 --> 38:29.908
You've been at it

38:29.908 --> 38:31.187
the whole night.

38:32.426 --> 38:33.540
So what did you learn?

38:37.187 --> 38:38.187
I figured it out.

38:39.027 --> 38:40.308
Look at this painting.

38:40.627 --> 38:41.187
See?

38:41.187 --> 38:42.708
That's a mountain, right?

38:43.388 --> 38:44.428
And the resemblance...

38:47.027 --> 38:48.228
is done right.

38:50.428 --> 38:50.908
Right.

38:51.788 --> 38:52.587
Oh, give me a break.

38:52.587 --> 38:53.348
Get downstairs.

38:53.348 --> 38:54.908
Don't embarrass us when they arrive.

38:55.187 --> 38:56.107
Ni, hurry up.

38:56.107 --> 38:57.147
We're heading down.

38:57.147 --> 38:58.187
Coming!

39:02.107 --> 39:04.268
Mom, Dad, this is Fei Ni.

39:04.337 --> 39:06.140
These are my parents-in-law.

39:06.147 --> 39:06.908
Hello, hello.

39:07.467 --> 39:09.708
Hello. You must be exhausted,
coming all this way.

39:09.708 --> 39:12.147
- Hello.
- Nice to meet you.

39:12.147 --> 39:13.107
You've had a long trip.

39:14.587 --> 39:15.547
In-law,

39:15.708 --> 39:17.748
a girl as lovely as Fei Ni

39:17.828 --> 39:19.428
married our boy.

39:19.604 --> 39:21.100
She must have made some sacrifices.

39:21.187 --> 39:22.547
Not at all.

39:29.627 --> 39:32.739
These are mushrooms
we brought back from Yunnan.

39:32.740 --> 39:33.937
They're incredibly delicious.

39:34.788 --> 39:35.467
Mom, Dad,

39:35.740 --> 39:37.004
before leaving Yunnan,

39:37.093 --> 39:39.420
my parents had someone
pick these from the mountains.

39:39.693 --> 39:41.540
They carried them
thousands of miles back.

39:41.547 --> 39:43.748
Oh, this is something special.

39:43.908 --> 39:45.708
These must be expensive.

39:46.027 --> 39:49.428
Not only have I never tasted this.

39:49.428 --> 39:50.708
I've never even seen it before.

39:50.788 --> 39:53.308
Mushrooms and tea leaves!
You've brought so much.

39:53.471 --> 39:54.820
You're making us feel embarrassed.

39:54.828 --> 39:56.828
We didn't prepare anything special.

39:57.388 --> 39:59.467
You raised such a wonderful daughter.

40:00.428 --> 40:01.828
Let's not stand around talking.

40:01.828 --> 40:03.627
Head home. I've got everything ready.

40:03.627 --> 40:05.987
I'll make a soup with these mushrooms.

40:05.987 --> 40:06.908
Come on, let's go.

40:06.908 --> 40:07.748
Yes, yes, let's eat.

40:07.748 --> 40:08.667
Come on, come on.

40:08.667 --> 40:09.428
We can have a drink.

40:09.428 --> 40:10.627
I've got good liquor.

40:10.627 --> 40:11.708
Let's go.

40:11.708 --> 40:12.822
(Promote Production)

40:12.828 --> 40:15.107
Look at this factory...

40:39.627 --> 40:40.948
Where are you going?

40:41.788 --> 40:44.187
My mom just called.
Grandma's unconscious.

40:44.428 --> 40:45.507
She may need surgery.

40:46.708 --> 40:47.467
I can't

40:47.467 --> 40:49.027
go with you to see your parents.

40:49.828 --> 40:51.147
I'll go back to Jiangnan with you.

40:52.187 --> 40:52.828
No.

40:53.137 --> 40:54.220
Your parents just got back.

40:54.228 --> 40:55.828
I can see them anytime.

40:56.388 --> 40:58.308
I want to go with you to see Grandma.

41:02.587 --> 41:03.748
I'll help you pack.

41:23.027 --> 41:24.027
No need to wait.

41:24.828 --> 41:26.187
She's probably not coming.

41:28.060 --> 41:29.180
Everything else aside,

41:29.788 --> 41:31.467
Fang and I

41:32.147 --> 41:33.267
have failed

41:34.587 --> 41:35.987
as parents.

41:37.987 --> 41:39.268
Since Yangyang was little,

41:39.748 --> 41:41.547
we were rarely there for him.

41:42.115 --> 41:43.340
Especially in these past years,

41:43.948 --> 41:45.228
he was sent down

41:45.748 --> 41:46.868
as a boy.

41:47.467 --> 41:48.587
Looking back now,

41:49.748 --> 41:51.268
we feel so ashamed.

41:55.107 --> 41:57.708
But after meeting Fei Ni

41:58.788 --> 42:00.627
and you two,

42:01.507 --> 42:03.708
we know that while we were away,

42:04.067 --> 42:06.147
Yang had a home.

42:07.067 --> 42:10.067
An even warmer home, in fact.

42:10.788 --> 42:11.587
Yes.

42:12.948 --> 42:14.067
These past two years,

42:14.547 --> 42:16.868
Yang must have caused you trouble.

42:17.627 --> 42:18.348
Not at all.

42:18.467 --> 42:19.868
Now that we're back,

42:19.868 --> 42:22.507
we won't ignore
the young couple's matters.

42:23.187 --> 42:24.748
Fei Ni, Yang,

42:25.187 --> 42:26.748
if you run into difficulties,

42:27.107 --> 42:28.868
you can always come to us.

42:29.515 --> 42:30.740
Speaking of difficulties...

42:33.948 --> 42:35.147
We actually do have one.

42:35.147 --> 42:35.828
What is it?

42:40.908 --> 42:41.667
Fei Ni and I

42:42.315 --> 42:43.900
would like to move back in with you.

42:47.788 --> 42:48.948
That would be wonderful.

42:49.547 --> 42:51.987
You're welcome to move back anytime.

42:52.908 --> 42:55.587
You can take Yang's old room.

42:55.587 --> 42:56.428
How about that?

42:59.948 --> 43:00.748
You're welcome.

43:02.708 --> 43:05.147
That's great news.

43:05.147 --> 43:07.587
The young couple finally has
a home of their own again.

43:07.587 --> 43:07.948
Right?

43:07.948 --> 43:09.948
Then let's raise a glass.

43:09.948 --> 43:11.268
Gather around.

43:11.467 --> 43:12.987
I'm not much of a speaker,

43:12.987 --> 43:14.388
so please bear with me.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
